CM_ "Test matrix for event triggered sending of tools/rtegen (COM-38): an event message with E2E profile 1 and a
minimum gap, a mixed message (cyclic and on change) with E2E profile 2, an event message without E2E and without a
gap, and a cyclic message without GenMsgSendType value. Not a board matrix, only used by the host test.";
